cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these data or code, please cite the article and the archived release."
title: "Heterogeneous multi-literature data-driven modelling of coagulation defluoridation"
abstract: >-
  Data, analysis code and result tables for a study that compiles 1,011 coagulation-defluoridation
  records from 27 literature-derived groups (22 independent publications) and evaluates random-split
  performance, source-isolated generalization, applicability boundaries and model interpretation.
